# BeatSwipe — Core Rules

Producer swipe portfolio for Instagram bio links. Fans swipe beats, save Favorites, buy via producer store links. BeatSwipe takes no cut. Luca = PO, deployer, user #1.

**More detail:** `@beatswipe-archive.mdc` (history, code maps, long changelogs — only when needed).

## Marketing

- **Never** say „Tinder" (brand)
- **Brand URL immer** `beatswipe.app` — nie nur „BeatSwipe" ohne TLD (Verwechslung mit **beatswipe.net**)
- Slogan: **Your bio link. Their next beat.**
- Product: „Your swipe page for the bio" / „Free swipe portfolio for producers"
- **Insta-DM (Producer, EN):** Kein Link in Nachricht 1 (wirkt wie Scam). Erst fragen (Interesse / private beta key). Nach Ja: nur `https://beatswipe.app/p/demo`. Key `BEATSWIPE25` erst wenn sie ihn wollen — nicht Homepage + Demo + Code + Schritte in einer Bubble. URLs immer mit `https://`.
- **Konkurrenz:** `beatswipe.net` live seit 25.06.2026 — TikTok-Feed, free downloads, collab; **anderes Produkt** als unsere Producer-`/p/`-Pages. Kontakt dort: `legal@beatswipe.com`. Wir: AT/EU, `hellobeatswipe@gmail.com`, `@beatswipe.app`

## Product (Phase 1)

- **Core:** `beatswipe.app/p/producername` — full-screen swipe portfolio (not a beat list profile)
- **Home:** Landing + tool marketing; Discover/Favorites exist but invite-gated
- **Onboarding:** Invite code from Luca (DM) — gated: Discover, Favorites, My Page, Profile. Open: Landing, `/p/*`
- **Monetization:** none now (student). No cut on beat sales.
- **Mobile-first** (Instagram traffic). App-Pages = Landing-Look (charcoal `#0E0E12` + blue bloom). `/p/` keeps white aurora + swipe glow, not app blue.

## Code layout

| File | Role |
|------|------|
| `index.html` | HTML + small init block |
| `app.js` | Discover, auth, favorites, profile, nav, swipe, toast |
| `mypage.js` | My Page upload, dashboard, beat edit/order |
| `portfolio.js` | `/p/` portfolio |
| `styles.css` | All CSS |
| `api/*.js` | beats, pending-beats, manage-beat, submit-beat, crate, delete-account, portfolio-meta, sitemap, track, stats, moderate-beats |
| `moderate.js` | Admin beat moderation UI (Luca only) |

**Script order:** `/app.js` → `/mypage.js` → `/portfolio.js` → `/moderate.js` → init inline in `index.html`

**Asset paths:** always root-absolute (`/styles.css`, `/app.js`, …) — relative breaks on `/p/slug` rewrites.

**No duplicate functions** across html/js modules.

